#, no-wrap
msgid "Compression"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Context Compression"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> Runtime context compression: conversations are **fully retained in the database**; only the **four-segment view** sent to the LLM is trimmed.\n"
"> Related: [`sleep.md`](sleep.md), [`memory.md`](memory.md).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:10 docs/concepts/sleep.md:13
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:21 docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Design Principles"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Principle           | Description                                                                    |\n"
"| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| No message deletion | History is kept; compression only changes runtime view and conversation meta   |\n"
"| Four segments       | LLM context = system + summary + slim + raw                                    |\n"
"| On-demand trigger   | Compress when usage nears window limits; higher thresholds in tool loops       |\n"
"| Memory-independent  | Compression does not trigger semantic extraction; light sleep cron is separate |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Runtime Four Segments"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"① system  — system prompt (self layer + resident memory + project context)\n"
"② summary — text summary of compressed portion (synthetic; not stored in messages)\n"
"③ slim    — middle segment: trimmed user/assistant messages\n"
"④ raw     — recent segment: full messages including tool calls\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:29
msgid ""
"Non-compression path: append new messages to raw only; boundaries unchanged."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:31
msgid ""
"Compression path: when usage exceeds thresholds, older messages move into "
"summary/slim; summary text updated asynchronously."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:35
msgid ""
"Adjust in `config.yaml` (full example: repo root `config.example.yaml`):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"models:\n"
"  deepseek-v4-flash:\n"
"    context_window: 1000000\n"
"\n"
"compression:\n"
"  enabled: true\n"
"  reserved_tokens: 8192\n"
"  trigger_low: 0.60 # outside tool loop: compress at 60% usage\n"
"  trigger_high: 0.80 # inside tool loop: compress at 80% usage\n"
"  emergency_ratio: 0.92\n"
"  raw_min_messages: 5\n"
"  slim_min_messages: 50\n"
"  summary_max_tokens: 4000\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Setting             | Default | Description                         |\n"
"| ------------------- | ------- | ----------------------------------- |\n"
"| `trigger_low`       | 0.60    | Threshold in normal conversation    |\n"
"| `trigger_high`      | 0.80    | Threshold inside tool loop          |\n"
"| `raw_min_messages`  | 5       | Minimum messages in raw segment     |\n"
"| `slim_min_messages` | 50      | Minimum messages in slim after trim |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:60
msgid "Without `context_window`, falls back to message-count triggers."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:62
msgid "Force compression in chat: `/compress` (`--force` ignores hysteresis)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "Relationship to Memory Pipeline"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:65
msgid ""
"Compression and light/deep sleep run **independently**: compression manages "
"the current conversation's LLM window; memory extraction runs nightly from "
"the full conversation archive."
msgstr ""
